message: "If you use this software or pilot scaffold, please cite it as below."
title: "rde-eval-scaffold: Experimental scaffold for Resonant Deviation Evaluator pilot studies"
authors:
  - family-names: "Kano"
    given-names: "Tomoyuki"
    email: "tomyuk@zyxcorp.jp"
    affiliation: "ZYX Corp."
repository-code: "https://github.com/zyx-corporation/rde-eval-scaffold"
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-19"
abstract: >-
  Experimental scaffold for evaluating Resonant Deviation Evaluator (RDE)
  taxonomy, risk flags, criticality, prompt-based candidate annotations,
  baseline metrics, and pilot source-output pairs. This repository is not a
  production RDE engine and does not claim benchmark-scale validation.
keywords:
  - Resonant Deviation Evaluator
  - semantic drift
  - generative AI evaluation
  - AI auditing
  - annotation scaffold
